OL,3,GNEWSAMural unveiled celebrating
OL,4,Asporting greats Crocker and Best
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural has been unveiled in south
OL,7,FBelfast to celebrate former IBF World
OL,8,FWelterweight Champion Lewis Crocker.
OL,10,FThe new artwork replaces the
OL,11,Flong-standing George Best mural on
OL,12,FBlythe Street in Sandy Row and now
OL,13,Ffeatures both sporting greats side by
OL,14,Fside.
OL,16,FThe official unveiling took place on
OL,17,FThursday evening.
OL,19,FLewis Crocker, who unveiled the mural,
OL,20,Fsaid it proved dreams can come true.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
